# game/script5.rpy:495
translate pt_br_anubisbr scene124_4_4fa5a807:

#   mc "After I left the castle to look for Maia, I got into quite a bit of trouble. With Abel. With Darius and his guards. And... with Gaius."
    mc "Depois que saí do castelo para procurar Maia, me meti em um grande problema. Com Abel. Com Darius e seus guardas. E... com Gaius."

# game/script5.rpy:497
translate pt_br_anubisbr scene124_4_097a1006:

#   r "I heard tids and pieces from the guards outside the cellar. Something about the market being destroyed... an explosion..."
